#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:161
msgid ""
"Specifies the maximum number of items that should be placed in a line before "
"starting a new row or column. If the value is 0 then all the available space "
"will be used."
msgstr ""
"Spesifiseer die maksimum nommer van iteme wat moet wees rangorde in 'n lyn voor "
"beginne 'n nuwe ry of kolom. As die waarde is 0 dan word alle die beskikbaar "
"spasie sal wees gebruik word."

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:164
msgid "Bo&xes per line: "
msgstr "Bokse per lyn:"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:180
msgid "&Detach from screen edge"
msgstr "Wegneem van skerm kant"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:181
msgid "Detaches the bar from the screen edge and makes it draggable."
msgstr "Wegneem die balk van die skerm kant en maak dit trekbaar."

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:194
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Agtergrond"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:196
msgid "Trans&parent"
msgstr "Deursigtig"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:197
msgid "Enables pseudo-transparent mode."
msgstr "Aktiveer pseudo-transparent modus."

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:201
msgid "Enable t&int"
msgstr "Aktiveer tint"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:203
msgid "Enables tinting the background that shows through in transparent mode."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer verdonkering van die agtergrond wat vertoon deur in transparent modus."

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:209
msgid "Specifies the color used for the background tint."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die kleur gebruik word vir die agtergrond tint."

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:213
msgid "Tint &color:"
msgstr "Tint kleur:"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:222
msgid "Specifies the strength of the background tint."
msgstr "Spesifiseer die sterkte van die agtergrond tint."

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:226
msgid "Tint &strength: "
msgstr "Tint sterkte: "

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:242
msgid "Thumbnails"
msgstr "Duimnaelskets"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:244
msgid "Enable thu&mbnails"
msgstr "Aktiveer duimnaelskets"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:246
msgid ""
"Enables the display of a thumbnailed image of the window when you move your "
"mouse pointer over an item. The thumbnails are approximate, and may not reflect "
"the current window contents.\n"
"\n"
"Using this option on a slow machine may cause performance problems."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer die vertoon van 'n duimnaelgeskets beeld van die venster wanneer jy "
"beweeg jou muis wyser bo 'n item. die duimnaelskets word skatting, en dalk mag "
"nie reflekteer die huidige venster inhoud.\n"
"\n"
"Te gebruik hierdie opsie op 'n stadige masjien dalk mag veroorsaak "
"produktiwiteit probleme."

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:253
msgid "&Embed thumbnails"
msgstr "Inpak duimnaels"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:259
msgid ""
"Controls the size of the window thumbnails. Using large sizes may cause "
"performance problems."
msgstr ""
"Kontroles die grootte van die venster duimnaelskets. Te gebruik groot grotes "
"dalk mag veroorsaak produktiwiteit probleme."

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:261
msgid "Thumbnail &size: "
msgstr "Duimnael grootte: "

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:271
msgid ""
"Controls the frequency with which the thumbnail of the active window is "
"updated. If the value is 0 then no updates will be performed.\n"
"\n"
"Using small values may cause performance problems on slow machines."
msgstr ""
"Kontroles die frekwensie met wat die duimnael van die aktief venster is "
"opgedateer. As die waarde is 0 dan word nee opdateer sal wees werkverrigting.\n"
"\n"
"Te gebruik klein waardes dalk mag veroorsaak produktiwiteit probleme op stadige "
"masjiene."

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:274
msgid "&Update thumbnail every: "
msgstr "Dateer op duimnael elke: "

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:279
msgid "seconds"
msgstr "sekondes"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:289
msgid "Behavior"
msgstr "Gedrag"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:291
msgid "&Group windows"
msgstr "Groep vensters"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:293
msgid "Enables the grouping together of related windows."
msgstr "Aktiveer die groepering tesame van verwanter vensters."

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:298
msgid "Show all &windows"
msgstr "Vertoon alle vensters"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:300
msgid ""
"Enables the display of all windows, not just those on the current desktop."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer die vertoon van alle vensters, nie net daardie op die huidige "
"werkskerm."

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:304
msgid "&Group windows on inactive desktops"
msgstr "Groep vensters op onaktiewe werkskerms"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:306
msgid ""
"Enables the grouping together of windows that are not on the current desktop."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer die groepering van vensters wat nie op die huidige werkskerm is nie."

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:311
msgid "Only show &minimized windows"
msgstr "Vertoon slegs minimeerde vensters"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:313
msgid ""
"When this option is checked only minimized windows are shown in the bar. This "
"gives Kasbar similar behavior to the icon handling in older environments like "
"CDE or OpenLook."
msgstr ""
"Indien hierdie opsie aangedui is sal slegs minimeerde vensters vertoon word in die balk. Dit "
"gee Kasbar soortgelyke gedrag tot die ikoon hantering in ouer omgewings soos "
"CDE of OpenLook."

