#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:400
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Georderde"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:403
msgid "Enable &startup notifier"
msgstr "Aktiveer opstart inkenissteller"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:405
msgid ""
"Enables the display of tasks that are starting but have not yet created a "
"window."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer die vertoon van take wat word begin is maar het nie 'n venster geskep "
"het nie."

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:411
msgid "Enable &modified indicator"
msgstr "Aktiveer veranderde aanduier"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:413
msgid ""
"Enables the display of a floppy disk state icon for windows containing a "
"modified document."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer die vertoon van 'n sagteskyf disket staat ikoon vir vensters bevat 'n "
"veranderde dokument."

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:418
msgid "Enable &progress indicator"
msgstr "Aktiveer veranderde aanduier"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:420
msgid ""
"Enables the display of a progress bar in the label of windows show are progress "
"indicators."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer die vertoon van 'n voortgaande balk in die etiket van vensters vertoon is "
"gevorderde aanduiers."

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:425
msgid "Enable &attention indicator"
msgstr "Aktiveer aandag aanduier"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:427
msgid ""
"Enables the display of an icon that indicates a window that needs attention."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer die vertoon van 'n ikoon wat dui op 'n venster wat aandag nodig het."

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:431
msgid "Enable frames for inactive items"
msgstr "Aktiveer rame vir onaktiewe items"

#: kasprefsdlg.cpp:433
msgid ""
"Enables frames around inactive items, if you want the bar to disappear into the "
"background you should probably uncheck this option."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer rame rondom onaktiewe items, as jy wil dat die balk verdwyn in die agtergrond "
"jy sal waarskynlik hierdie opsie nie aandui nie."

